diskdiet drives Mole (https://github.com/tw93/Mole), which is licensed under
the GNU General Public License v3.0. Mole is not included in this repository:
the user installs it separately (for example with `brew install mole`), and
diskdiet only runs the installed `mo` program as a separate process. No Mole
source code is copied here. The test fixture tests/fixtures/mole-lib/ is
written for this project and only mirrors the shape of Mole's variables.
